                                                </p>
                                            </div>

                                            <div class="mb-3 mb-md-4 mb-lg-5">
                                                <h6 class="fw-bold">In-App Payments and Invoicing:</h6>
                                                <p class="mb-0">
                                                    Secure payments, automatic receipts, and payout tracking for
                                                    professionals.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>

                                            <div class="mb-3 mb-md-4 mb-lg-5">
                                                <h6 class="fw-bold">Brand Sponsor Portal:</h6>
                                                <p class="mb-0">
                                                    Tools for partners to launch challenges and track campaign results.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>

                                            <div class="mb-3 mb-md-4 mb-lg-5">
                                                <h6 class="fw-bold">Multilingual Support and Accessibility:</h6>
                                                <p class="mb-0">
                                                    Regional languages and accessible design.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>

                                            <div class="mb-3 mb-md-4 mb-lg-5">
                                                <h6 class="fw-bold">Admin and Analytics Console:</h6>
                                                <p class="mb-0">
                                                    Moderation, fraud review, partner onboarding, reward settings, and
                                                    platform insights.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>

                                        </div>

                                    </div>

                                </div>
